# Study data caches (moved out of backend/scripts/ on 2026-08-06). The
# contents are IRREPLACEABLE and must never be deleted to reclaim space:
# cache/texts/ is 2,844 EDGAR filings (~$100 of fetches) and cache/llm_contam/
# is $118.09 of inference from models that have since been retired.
